# Lab 4 reference test directory

Updated November 4, 2026. This original lab directory contains no implemented
unit tests; PlatformIO's generated template is not evidence of test coverage.
From the Lab 4 project directory, `pio run -e esp32thing_plus -j 4` checks
compilation against its existing board configuration. Hardware behavior requires
the lab equipment and procedure.

The completed file/camera firmware and its real host interoperability tests are
in [Lab 8](../../Astro331_Lab8_Code/README.md#automated-compatibility-tests).
Run its `test/test_protocol.py --gcs /path/to/KestrelSAT-GCS -v` from the Lab 8
project with the required Python dependencies, POSIX PTY support and C++ compiler.
These checks do not run automatically just because this reference directory is
named `test`, and they do not replace physical camera/radio tests.
